# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and the working tree.
# This overrides each developer's core.autocrlf, so line endings stay
# consistent across every clone (Windows dev + Windows VM, macOS) and git
# stops converting LF<->CRLF -- which is what produced the "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warnings. LF works fine for Python tooling on Windows.
# Binary files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
